{"id":"vd-a1-the-dog-at-the-door","level":"a1","n":15,"title":{"en":"Is This Your Dog?","vi":"Đây có phải chó của bà không?"},"summary":"Bà Hill đến nhà Oscar sau khi thấy tấm áp phích; để chắc chắn, Oscar hỏi bà tả con chó của mình trông thế nào.","source":{"type":"story","id":"st-a1-the-dog-at-the-door","level":"a1","title":{"en":"The Dog at the Door","vi":"Chú chó trước cửa nhà"}},"scene":{"background":"home-day","props":[{"id":"puppy","x":790}]},"cast":{"oscar":{"name":{"en":"Oscar","vi":"Oscar"},"look":"boy","x":560,"style":{"hair":"curly","hairColor":"#1F1A1C","skin":"#8D5A3B","skinShade":"#74472D","top":"#3F7FCB","topShade":"#2F66AA","collar":"#2F66AA"}},"hill":{"name":{"en":"Mrs. Hill","vi":"Bà Hill"},"look":"grandma","x":1150,"from":0}},"lines":[{"speaker":"hill","en":"Hello. I saw your poster. I'm looking for my dog.","vi":"Chào cháu. Bà thấy tấm áp phích của cháu. Bà đang đi tìm con chó của bà.","ipa":["həˈloʊ","aɪ","sɔ","jɔɹ","ˈpoʊstɚ","aɪm","ˈlʊkɪŋ","fɔɹ","maɪ","dɔɡ"],"start":0.554,"end":5.844,"expression":"worried","timing":[[0,0.554],[1,2.069],[2,2.296],[3,2.594],[4,2.793],[5,4.441],[6,4.696],[7,5.023],[8,5.165],[9,5.307]]},{"speaker":"oscar","en":"Hello. What does your dog look like?","vi":"Cháu chào bà. Chó của bà trông thế nào ạ?","ipa":["həˈloʊ","wʌt","dʌz","jɔɹ","dɔɡ","lʊk","laɪk"],"start":6.634,"end":9.814,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,6.634],[1,8.12],[2,8.404],[3,8.631],[4,8.83],[5,9.271],[6,9.526]]},{"speaker":"hill","en":"It's small. It's brown and white.","vi":"Nó nhỏ thôi. Lông màu nâu trắng.","ipa":["ɪts","smɔl","ɪts","bɹaʊn","ənd","waɪt"],"start":10.604,"end":13.664,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,10.604],[1,10.791],[2,12.346],[3,12.602],[4,13.084],[5,13.227]]},{"speaker":"oscar","en":"Does it have a collar?","vi":"Nó có đeo vòng cổ không ạ?","ipa":["dʌz","ɪt","hæv","ə","ˈkɑlɚ"],"start":14.454,"end":15.724,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,14.454],[1,14.631],[2,14.773],[3,15.043],[4,15.142]]},{"speaker":"hill","en":"Yes, it has a red collar.","vi":"Có, nó đeo một cái vòng cổ màu đỏ.","ipa":["jɛs","ɪt","hæz","ə","ɹɛd","ˈkɑlɚ"],"start":16.514,"end":18.474,"gesture":"nod","timing":[[0,16.514],[1,17.245],[2,17.358],[3,17.586],[4,17.671],[5,17.969]]},{"speaker":"oscar","en":"Hmm. And its ears? Are they big?","vi":"Ưm. Còn tai nó thì sao ạ? Tai có to không ạ?","ipa":["hm","ənd","ɪts","ɪɹz","ɑɹ","ðeɪ","bɪɡ"],"start":19.264,"end":23.494,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,19.264],[1,20.734],[2,20.962],[3,21.175],[4,22.68],[5,22.908],[6,23.106]]},{"speaker":"hill","en":"Yes, very big! And one ear is white.","vi":"Có, to lắm! Mà một bên tai màu trắng.","ipa":["jɛs","ˈvɛɹi","bɪɡ","ənd","wʌn","iɹ","ɪz","waɪt"],"start":24.284,"end":28.204,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,24.284],[1,24.948],[2,25.346],[3,26.83],[4,27.043],[5,27.284],[6,27.583],[7,27.753]]},{"speaker":"oscar","en":"One white ear… Just a moment.","vi":"Một bên tai trắng… Bà đợi cháu một chút.","ipa":["wʌn","waɪt","iɹ","dʒʌst","ə","ˈmoʊmənt"],"start":28.994,"end":32.254,"expression":"surprised","timing":[[0,28.994],[1,29.284],[2,29.654],[3,31.038],[4,31.464],[5,31.535]]},{"speaker":"oscar","en":"Is this your dog?","vi":"Đây có phải chó của bà không ạ?","ipa":["ɪz","ðɪs","jɔɹ","dɔɡ"],"start":32.794,"end":33.934,"expression":"happy","gesture":"point","prop":"puppy","timing":[[0,32.794],[1,32.952],[2,33.251],[3,33.449]]},{"speaker":"hill","en":"Biscuit! Oh, it's you!","vi":"Biscuit! Ôi, đúng là con rồi!","ipa":["ˈbɪskət","oʊ","ɪts","ju"],"start":34.724,"end":37.494,"expression":"tearful","gesture":"cheer","timing":[[0,34.724],[1,36.257],[2,36.854],[3,37.109]]},{"speaker":"oscar","en":"His name is Biscuit? I called him Rainy.","vi":"Nó tên là Biscuit ạ? Cháu gọi nó là Rainy.","ipa":["hɪz","neɪm","ɪz","ˈbɪskət","aɪ","kɔld","hɪm","ˈɹeɪni"],"start":38.284,"end":42.044,"expression":"shy","timing":[[0,38.284],[1,38.461],[2,38.816],[3,39],[4,40.627],[5,40.84],[6,41.266],[7,41.536]]},{"speaker":"hill","en":"Rainy is a good name, too. Thank you so much.","vi":"Rainy cũng là một cái tên hay. Cảm ơn cháu nhiều lắm.","ipa":["ˈɹeɪni","ɪz","ə","ɡʊd","neɪm","tu","θæŋk","ju","soʊ","mʌtʃ"],"start":42.834,"end":47.044,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,42.834],[1,43.238],[2,43.394],[3,43.479],[4,43.693],[5,44.232],[6,45.702],[7,45.986],[8,46.143],[9,46.483]]},{"speaker":"oscar","en":"He is a very good dog.","vi":"Nó là một chú chó rất ngoan ạ.","ipa":["hi","ɪz","ə","ˈvɛɹi","ɡʊd","dɔɡ"],"start":47.834,"end":49.484,"expression":"sad","timing":[[0,47.834],[1,48.025],[2,48.21],[3,48.309],[4,48.778],[5,49.062]]},{"speaker":"hill","en":"Then come and walk him on Saturday!","vi":"Thế thì thứ Bảy cháu sang dắt nó đi dạo nhé!","ipa":["ðɛn","kʌm","ənd","wɔk","hɪm","ɑn","ˈsætɚdi"],"start":50.274,"end":52.324,"expression":"happy","react":{"oscar":"happy"},"timing":[[0,50.274],[1,50.532],[2,50.83],[3,50.972],[4,51.285],[5,51.427],[6,51.611]]}],"words":[{"id":"dog","en":"dog","ipa":"dɔɡ","vi":"con chó; chó","level":0},{"id":"brown","en":"brown","ipa":"bɹaʊn","vi":"nâu; màu nâu","level":0},{"id":"small","en":"small","ipa":"smɔl","vi":"nhỏ; bé","level":0},{"id":"ear","en":"ear","ipa":"iɹ","vi":"cái tai; tai","level":0},{"en":"poster","ipa":"ˈpoʊstɚ","vi":"áp phích"}],"focus":{"title":"Miêu tả con vật / đồ vật","pattern":"It's + tính từ (small, brown…) · It has + danh từ (a red collar, big ears…) · Is it…? / Does it have…?","explain":"Tả đặc điểm dùng \"It's + tính từ\": It's small. Tả thứ nó có dùng \"It has + danh từ\": It has big ears. Hỏi lại cho chắc: \"Is it…?\", \"Does it have…?\".","keys":["it's small","it has","does it have","is it"],"lines":[2,3,4]},"audio":{"src":"/audio/library/videos/vd-a1-the-dog-at-the-door.mp3","v":"1352cb6559","duration":53.424,"fps":25,"mouth":""}}